ction fantasy historical fiction  romance slice of life and so  just like a Hollywood movie or a cable  TV series the point is that anime is not  just one genre anime is a diverse medium  with many different genres just like you  can't judge Hollywood movies in general  based on rom-coms you can judge all of  anime based on one or two animate a use  sign you thought were childish imagine  if a Japanese person who grew up  watching anime saw M night Shyamalan The  Last Airbender and decided based on that  one film that all Hollywood movies were  a shitty uninspired disaster of course  you can't judge all Hollywood movies  based on that one shitty movie that will  be ridiculous the truth is that most of  those people who go around hating on  anime have no idea what anime actually  is they don't understand it they think  that because anime doesn't play any part  in their lives and because it comes from  a culture that is foreign to them that  it should be ridiculed and that people  from this culture the Western culture  who like it should also be ridiculed but  that of course is insane no one should  criticize a Japanese person for liking a  great Hollywood movie and no one should  criticize a Western anime fan for liking  a great anime so yeah guys those are  just some of my thoughts on this whole  issue and PewDiePie if you're watching  of course you're not watching no one's  watching oh yeah guys just in general  don't fall into the trap of being  embarrassed about liking anime just  because some people out there don't  understand anime and don't know what  it's about  you should be proud and you should help  spread awareness about what a creative  and unique medium anime is and who knows  maybe someone else will hear what you  have to say and they're gonna check out  anime and discover a whole new world  that wasn't open to them before so yeah  that's it for me thank you very much for  watching and if you have thoughts on  this issue please leave it in the  comment